{
 "post_id": "var-hobbies-4",
 "slides": {
  "1": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "10/10 hobbies to make you",
      "extremely intelligent"
     ],
     "texte": "Hobbys für diesen Winter, die dein Gehirn wacher machen"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "(neuroscience approved)"
     ],
     "texte": "(echt belegt, kein Trend)",
     "alignement": "droite"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_007ca065.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       2368,
       1760
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "2": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "train a martial art"
     ],
     "texte": "belege [[einen Abendkurs]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "you get corrected constantly, exposed when your",
      "technique is bad, and forced to keep going when",
      "you're tired"
     ],
     "texte": "Geschichte, Astronomie, Recht: echte Lehrkraft, echte Fragen und [[jede Woche etwas vorzubereiten]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "martial arts teaches",
      "you to stay calm under",
      "pressure"
     ],
     "texte": "Kurse als Erwachsene gehen mit [[weniger Demenz]] einher"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "instead of quitting the",
      "second something gets",
      "uncomfortable"
     ],
     "texte": "und sie holen dich raus, [[wenn's um 17 Uhr dunkel ist]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_457366c6.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       2496,
       1664
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "3": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "never miss twice"
     ],
     "texte": "mach [[Yoga]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "missed the gym today? fine. ate badly? move on.",
      "wasted three hours scrolling? don't waste the next",
      "three."
     ],
     "texte": "eine Pose halten, dem Atem folgen, den Ablauf ohne Blick zur Lehrerin schaffen: dein Gehirn [[bleibt bei einer Sache]], eine ganze Stunde"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "the real damage isn't",
      "making a mistake."
     ],
     "texte": "8 Wochen: [[besseres Gedächtnis]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "it's using that mistake as",
      "permission to keep going."
     ],
     "texte": "und die Matte passt [[in dein Zimmer]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_05c19636.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       2368,
       1760
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "4": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "study longer than you want to"
     ],
     "texte": "geh jeden Monat [[ins Museum]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "the useful part usually starts when your brain",
      "wants to quit"
     ],
     "texte": "such dir ein Bild aus und [[schau es 10 Minuten an]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "stay for another",
      "20–30 minutes",
      "after you feel",
      "bored, distracted,",
      "or restless"
     ],
     "texte": "wer oft ins Museum geht, hat 10 Jahre später [[ein geringeres Demenzrisiko]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "you're not just learning the subject, you're training",
      "yourself to keep going when motivation disappears"
     ],
     "texte": "du gehst mit einer Geschichte, einem Künstlernamen und einer Frage raus, [[besser als jeder Feed]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_f8c4c2ab.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       1664,
       2496
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "5": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "stop announcing your plans"
     ],
     "texte": "heb [[Gewichte]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "telling everyone your goals can give you a hit of",
      "dopamine before you've actually done anything"
     ],
     "texte": "Kniebeugen, Kreuzheben: zählen, Technik halten, [[weitermachen, wenn's brennt]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "you get to feel",
      "ambitious, receive",
      "praise, and imagine",
      "the end result",
      "without putting in",
      "the work"
     ],
     "texte": "bei Älteren hat ein halbes Jahr Krafttraining [[das Gedächtniszentrum geschützt]], bis zu ein Jahr danach"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "stop talking about what you're going to do. disappear,",
      "put your head down, and let your results speak for you"
     ],
     "texte": "zwei Einheiten pro Woche reichen, und das Gym ist wenigstens [[geheizt]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_12812cb9.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       1760,
       2368
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "6": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "read books instead of scrolling"
     ],
     "texte": "bau dir [[einen Gedächtnispalast]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "a book makes you follow one idea for pages.",
      "scrolling trains that out of your head"
     ],
     "texte": "stell dir deine Wohnung vor und leg alles, was du dir merken willst, [[in ein Zimmer]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "if you want to think",
      "deeper, give your brain",
      "something long before",
      "anything short"
     ],
     "texte": "in 6 Wochen haben Anfänger [[mehr als doppelt so viele Wörter]] behalten"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "i use readup which blocks",
      "my apps until i read for 20",
      "minutes, which stopps me",
      "from scrolling"
     ],
     "texte": "was diesen Winter mein Scrollen ersetzt: Yoga, Museum und der Urknall in 5 Min. in [[der Sophia-App]]"
    }
   },
